          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2></h2><p><strong>Freight</strong><br/>Transportation charges are negotiable.</p><p><strong>Prices</strong><br/>Prices per roll (unless otherwise indicated), are subject to change without notice and will be billed at the prevailing price at the time of shipment. Price discrepancies will be confirmed prior to shipment.</p><p><strong>Payment Terms</strong><br/>Net 30 days subject to credit approval. Past due accounts subject to service charge of 1.5% per month on unpaid balance until paid. Our customers are valuable to us. To ensure the best quality and service, we in return would expect our customers to respect our payment term policy.</p><p><strong>Deliveries</strong><br/>Shipments will be made as close to promise date as indicated at the time of order. Unfortunately, we have no control of certain factors that may occur to change date of shipment.</p><p><strong>Returns & Claims</strong><br/>All merchandise (including tooling and plates) delivered is non-returnable, except as authorized in writing by <strong>NADCO</strong>®. Unauthorized returns will be refused. Authorized returns will be subject to a re-stocking fee.</p>",
