          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Lost Goods</strong><br/>DO NOT SIGN DELIVERY RECEIPT until you count all pieces. Sign only for what you have received. If you signed short, contact <strong>NADCO</strong>® immediately, and <strong>NADCO</strong>® will proceed to file a loss claim. If replacement is needed, a new purchase order number will be required.</p><p><strong>Damaged Goods</strong><br/>UPON DELIVERY, inspect all goods CAREFULLY for damage. If goods are damaged, sign delivery receipt for damage and contact <strong>NADCO</strong>® immediately for further instructions. If replacement is needed, a new purchase order number will be required.</p>",
